/* HOUSEKEEPING */
:: Housekeeping Classroom Poppy Help
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<schooleffects>><<effects>><<run poppySchedule()>>
You ask Poppy for help. How do you want to conduct yourself?
<br><br>
<<link [[Focus|Housekeeping Classroom Poppy Help Focus]]>><</link>><<glove>><<ghousekeeping>><<handholdingvirginitywarning>>
<br>
<<link [[Daydream|Housekeeping Classroom Poppy Help Daydream]]>><<stress -3>><<tiredness -1.5>><</link>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>

:: Housekeeping Classroom Poppy Help Focus
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<schooleffects>><<effects>>
<<run markPoppyInteraction()>><<npcincr Poppy patience 2>>
You ask Poppy for help and make an effort to focus properly. 
<br><br>
<<He>> seems pleased by your behaviour, patiently explaining and giving you tips on how to improve, even going as far as to hold your hand to guide you through the steps you find troubling.
<<takeHandholdingVirginity "Poppy" "romantic">><<npcincr Poppy love 1>><<glove>><<housekeeping 1 1000>><<ghousekeeping 1000>>
<<set $poppyHousekeepingGuidanceSeen to 1>>
<br><br>
"Alright," Poppy clasps <<his>> hands together. "If you have any more questions, feel free to ask River or me during class, okay?" <<He>> sends you on your way.
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Hallways]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Housekeeping Classroom Poppy Help Daydream
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<schooleffects>><<effects>>
<<run markPoppyInteraction()>><<npcincr Poppy patience -2>>
As Poppy teaches, you slowly start to space out. Poppy takes notice and snaps you out of your daze with a stern look. "Please pay attention." <<stress 4>><<gstress>>
<br><br>
You straighten your posture and try to focus, but your mind refuses to listen. In the end, you learn nothing at all.
<<set $poppyHousekeepingGuidanceSeen to 1>>
<br><br>
"Alright," Poppy clasps <<his>> hands together. "If you have any more questions, feel free to ask River or me during class, okay?" <<He>> sends you on your way.
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Hallways]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Housekeeping Classroom Poppy Kiss
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<schooleffects>><<effects>><<run poppySchedule()>>
<<run markPoppyInteraction()>>
You lean in and give Poppy a quick kiss on the cheek. <<Hes>> caught off guard for a split second, then narrows <<his>> eyes at you.
<br><br>
"You don't think that will get you out of your current predicament, do you?" <<He>> leans in, <<his>> breath ghosting your lips.
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<link [[Take it further|Housekeeping Classroom Poppy Take It Further]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Apologise instead|Housekeeping Classroom Poppy Apologise]]>><</link>>

:: Housekeeping Classroom Poppy Take It Further
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<schooleffects>><<effects>>
<<run markPoppyInteraction()>>
You kiss Poppy on the lips this time, and <<he>> leans into it. You hear the faint click of the classroom door being locked.
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<link [[Kiss|Poppy Sex Housekeeping Classroom]]>><<set $sexstart to 1>><</link>>

:: Poppy Sex Housekeeping Classroom
<<if $sexstart is 1>>
	<<set $sexstart to 0>>
	<<consensual>>
	<<set $consensual to 1>>
	<<neutral 1>>
	<<maninit>>
	<<set $enemytrust += 500>><<npcexpose>>
	<<npckiss>>
	<<set $enemyarousalmax to 600>>
	<<set $enemyarousalmax to $enemyarousalmax * ($nnpcArousalMult / 100)>>
	Poppy gives in for a heated moment, letting you steal a rough, breathless make-out session against the wall.
<</if>>
<<set $enemyanger to 0>>
<<effects>>
<<effectsman>>
<<man>>
<<stateman>>
<br><br>
<<actionsman>>
<<if _combatend>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Poppy Sex Housekeeping Classroom Finish]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Poppy Sex Housekeeping Classroom]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>

:: Poppy Sex Housekeeping Classroom Finish
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<schooleffects>><<effects>>
<<if $enemypleasure gte $enemypleasuremax>>
	<<ejaculation>>	Poppy stays close, breathing evening out as <<he>> looks at you with a small, satisfied smile.<<npcincr Poppy lust -12>><<llust>>
<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
	"Pff... careful," Poppy murmurs, sounding more amused than offended.
<<else>>
	<<encounterEndViolence>>
	Poppy stays close, fingertips trailing lightly along your skin.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<He>> kisses you one last time before sending you on your way. "Go now, you got what you wanted. Never do that again or I'm gonna spank you." 
<br><br>
<<He>> gives you a light reprimand. You leave the housekeeping classroom, unspanked.
<<clotheson>><<endcombat>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Hallways]]>><</link>>

:: Housekeeping Classroom Poppy Apologise
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<schooleffects>><<effects>>
<<run markPoppyInteraction()>>
You apologise to Poppy for your behaviour. <<His>> hand slides away from beside your head. "Fine, now go. Never do that again or I'm gonna spank you." 
<br><br>
<<He>> gives you a light reprimand. You leave the housekeeping classroom, unspanked.
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Hallways]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Housekeeping Lesson Focus Poppy Yes
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<schooleffects>><<effects>><<run poppySchedule()>>
<<if $housekeeping gte 850>>
	You ask Poppy for help, even going as far as to hold your hand and guide you through the steps you find troubling. 
	But then, <<he>> realises that you've already got a grasp on all the basics. "Very good. All you need to do is some refining. Keep it up."
	<<takeHandholdingVirginity "Poppy" "romantic">><<npcincr Poppy love 3>><<glove>><<housekeeping 1 1000>><<ghousekeeping 1000>>
<<else>>
	You ask Poppy for help. <<He>> patiently explains and gives you tips on how to improve, even going as far as to hold your hand and guide you through the steps you find troubling. You feel grateful for <<his>> guidance, and you feel that you've learned a lot.
	<<takeHandholdingVirginity "Poppy" "romantic">><<npcincr Poppy love 1>><<glove>><<housekeeping 1 1000>><<ghousekeeping 1000>>
<</if>>
<<if ($poppyHousekeepingGuidanceSeen is undefined or $poppyHousekeepingGuidanceSeen isnot 1)>>
	<br><br>
	"If you need anything, feel free to come find me before class, during recess or after school." Poppy flashes you a smile and walks off.
	<<poppyOpiumPulse null 1>>
<<else>>
	<br><br>
	"If you need anything, feel free to come find me." Poppy flashes you a smile and walks off.
	<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<</if>>
<<set $poppyHousekeepingGuidanceSeen to 1>>
<<advancelesson>><<housekeeping _lesson_gain>><<stress _lesson_progress>>
<<if $phase is 1>>
	<<endevent>><<lessonEnd "housekeepingClassroom">>
<<else>>
	<<link [[Next|Housekeeping Lesson]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Housekeeping Lesson Focus Poppy No
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<schooleffects>><<effects>><<run poppySchedule()>>
"I'm alright, I can keep up for now," you say.
<br><br>
<<if ($poppyHousekeepingGuidanceSeen is undefined or $poppyHousekeepingGuidanceSeen isnot 1)>>
	Poppy nods. "If you need anything, feel free to come find me before class, during recess or after school."
	<<poppyOpiumPulse null 1>>
<<else>>
	Poppy nods. "If you need anything, feel free to come find me."
	<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<</if>>
<<set $poppyHousekeepingGuidanceSeen to 1>>
<<advancelesson>><<housekeeping _lesson_gain>><<stress _lesson_progress>>
<<if $phase is 1>>
	<<endevent>><<lessonEnd "housekeepingClassroom">>
<<else>>
	<<link [[Next|Housekeeping Lesson]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>

/* SOUPKITCHEN */
:: Soup Kitchen Poppy Help
<<effects>><<run poppySchedule()>>
You rush over to carry some of the dishes from Poppy. Both of you bring them to the back of the kitchen and dunk them into the sink filled with soapy water.
<<glove>><<npcincr Poppy love 1>>
<br><br>
"Thanks! Couldn't have done it without your help. I would've most definitely dropped something." 
<br><br>
Poppy pats your shoulder twice before hurrying off to tend to other tasks. You continue on with your initial work.
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<link [[Next|Soup Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Soup Kitchen Poppy Busy
<<effects>>
You tell Poppy that you also have your hands tied at the moment. <<He>> nods with a smile and hurries off to the kitchen.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Soup Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

/*
	Entry point reached from the main :: Hallways passage when:
	  - poppySchedule() returned poppy_location "schoolHallways"
	  - Poppy is introduced (talk_intro seen)
	  - Status data is valid (no DataInvalid flag)
	  - Player is not exposed ($exposed lt 1) while sneaking around naked the PC
	    is hiding from everyone, so no casual Poppy pass-by / confrontation fires
	  - $schoolstate is an actual class period (not morning / lunch / afternoon)

	Poppy is only at schoolHallways during active class hours (9am-3pm). The Hallways
	gate further filters out lunch / morning / afternoon so the PC is always in the
	hallway when they should be in class when this dispatch fires.
*/
:: Hallways Poppy Event Dispatch
<<schooleffects>><<effects>><<run statusCheck("Poppy")>>
<<set _poppyLowPatience to (Array.isArray(T.poppyStatus) and T.poppyStatus.includes("LowPatience"))>>
<<if _poppyHallwayContext is "class">>
	<<include "Hallways Poppy Skipping">>
<<elseif $awarelevel gte 5 and $settings.transformAnimalEnabled and !_poppyLowPatience>>
	<<include "Hallways Poppy TF Pass">>
<<else>>
	<<include "Hallways Poppy Shoulder Pass">>
<</if>>

/* TF PASS  (Awareness 5+, transformAnimalEnabled, no LowPatience) */
:: Hallways Poppy TF Pass
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<schooleffects>><<run poppySchedule()>>
<<effects>><<run markPoppyInteraction()>><<npc Poppy>><<person1>>
You are in the school hallway when someone walks past you, and their tail brushes across your chest, catching you by surprise. 
<br><br>
You turn to see that it's Poppy.
<br><br>
With a coy smile, <<he>> walks off as <<his>> tail drags along your arm, leaving you slightly flustered.<<arousal 400>><<garousal>>
<<if T.poppyLIAvailable>><<npcincr Poppy lust 2>><<glust>><</if>>
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<link [[Next|Hallways]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>

/* SHOULDER PASS  (low awareness, no LowPatience) */
:: Hallways Poppy Shoulder Pass
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<schooleffects>><<run poppySchedule()>>
<<effects>><<run markPoppyInteraction()>><<npc Poppy>><<person1>>
You are in the school hallway when someone walks past you and their shoulder hits yours, catching you by surprise. 
<br><br>
You turn to see that it's Poppy.
<br><br>
With a coy smile, <<he>> walks off as <<his>> hand drags along your arm, leaving you slightly flustered.
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<link [[Next|Hallways]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>

/* SKIPPING CONFRONTATION  (always available, including LowPatience) */
:: Hallways Poppy Skipping
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<schooleffects>><<run poppySchedule()>>
<<effects>><<run markPoppyInteraction()>><<npc Poppy>><<person1>>
You are in the school hallway, you hear someone clears their throat behind you. You turn around to see Poppy looking at you, clearly unamused. 
<br><br>
It would be wise to go back to class.
<<llove>><<npcincr Poppy love -3>><<npcincr Poppy patience -2>><<if C.npc.Poppy.patience gte 0>><<lpatience>><<else>><<ganger>><</if>><<gdelinquency>><<delinquency 3>><<gstress>><<stress 5>>
<<poppyOpiumPulse>><<detention 1>>
<<link [[Next|Hallways]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>


/*
	Poppy-Bailey morning meeting event.
	Triggered from :: Bailey's Office when:
	  - Poppy's schedule places her at baileyOffice (weekends/holidays from 7AM for 25–60 minutes)
	  - Poppy has been introduced (talk_intro seen via poppySchedule guard)
	  - Poppy is not yet a Love Interest ($poppyromance < 0 or unset)
	  - RNG 1-in-2 passes (first encounter only)

	$daily.poppy.baileyMeeting tracks state for the day:
	  undefined / falsy  = event hasn't fired yet today
	  1                  = first encounter seen; repeat encounter shown on re-entry
*/
/* FIRST ENCOUNTER */
:: Bailey's Office Poppy Meeting
<<effects>><<set $outside to 0>><<run markPoppyInteraction()>><<run poppySchedule()>>
You enter Bailey's office and find <<him>> sitting at <<his>> desk.
<br><br>
You find a special guest sitting at the edge of Bailey's desk, facing <<him>>. You recognise those crimson red locks. It's Poppy. Bailey looks at you and scowls.
<br><br>
"Out."
<br><br>
Poppy turns <<nnpc_his "Poppy">> head to look at you over <<nnpc_his "Poppy">> shoulder. <<nnpc_He "Poppy">> gives you a slight smile and flicks <<nnpc_his "Poppy">> wrist twice, requesting you to leave.
<br><br>
<<main_hall_icon>><<link [[Main hall (0:01)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

/* REPEAT ENCOUNTER */
:: Bailey's Office Poppy Repeat
<<effects>><<set $outside to 0>>
Bailey and Poppy are inside the office. You can hear them talking but it's too muffled for you to make out what they're saying. 
<br><br>
It's best not to disturb them further.
<br><br>
<<main_hall_icon>><<link [[Main hall (0:01)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 1>><<endevent>><</link>>


/*
	Ocean Breeze Cafe, Poppy lunch event
	Entry point from :: Ocean Breeze

	Availability:
	- Weekend only, 1PM-3PM. Disabled when Poppy has Low Patience
*/
:: Ocean Breeze Poppy
<<set $outside to 0>><<run poppySchedule()>><<effects>><<npc Poppy>><<person1>>
Poppy took notice of you approaching <<his>> table and smiled at you. "Hey! Fancy seeing you here. Care to join me for awhile?"
<<poppyOpiumPulse>><<run markPoppyInteraction()>>
<<link [[Agree to join <<him>> (0:30)|Ocean Breeze Poppy Join]]>><<pass 30>><</link>><br>
<<link [[Say that you're busy|Ocean Breeze Poppy Busy]]>><</link>>

/* JOIN TO EAT TOGETHER */
:: Ocean Breeze Poppy Join
<<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<run poppySchedule()>>
You nod and sit across from Poppy. <<He>> calls a waiter over and orders another stack of pancakes for you. 
<br><br>
"Don't worry about paying, it's my treat." <<He>> winks.<<if T.poppyLoveGainAllowed>><<npcincr Poppy love 1>><<glove>><</if>>
<br><br>
You chat with Poppy as you eat. The pancakes are delicious. Poppy asks you about your day and also tells you about <<his>> day. Both of you have a pleasant conversation.
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<link [[Next|Ocean Breeze Poppy Departure]]>><</link>>

:: Ocean Breeze Poppy Departure
<<set $outside to 0>><<effects>>
<<if Number($poppyromance) gte 0>>
	"Ah... I'm stuffed. Time flies by whenever I'm with you." Poppy stands up with a sigh. "Thanks for keeping me company, my love."
	<br><br>
	<<He>> kisses you on the cheek. 
	<br><br>
	"Remember to come see me again, I'll be waiting. Bye bye now." <<He>> whispers into your ear before leaving with a giggle.<<arousal 200>><<garousal>>
<<else>>
	"Ah... I'm stuffed. I think it's time for me to go." Poppy stands up with a grunt. 
	<br><br>
	"Thanks for joining me for lunch, I enjoyed your company. See you later!" <<He>> waves to you and walks out of the cafe.
<</if>>
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<link [[Back to the cafe|Ocean Breeze]]>><<endevent>><<set $daily.poppy.cafeEat to true>><</link>>

/* REFUSE TO EAT TOGETHER */
:: Ocean Breeze Poppy Busy
<<set $outside to 0>><<effects>>
"Maybe next time," you say. Poppy nods understandingly and redirects <<his>> focus back to <<his>> plate of pancakes.
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<link [[Back to the cafe|Ocean Breeze]]>><<endevent>><<set $daily.poppy.cafeRefuse to true>><</link>>


/*
	Entry point reached from the main :: Temple / main hall passage when:
	  - weekend, time is after 3PM, awareness is 5+
	  - Poppy is introduced (talk_intro seen), Poppy status data is valid, Poppy is not in LowPatience

	This is a one-time RNG story event, not a repeatable social loop.
*/
:: Temple Poppy Fallen Story Intro
<<set $outside to 0>><<run markPoppyInteraction()>><<run poppySchedule()>><<npc Poppy>><<person1>>
<<if !$poppySeen.includes("temple_fallen_story")>><<set $poppySeen.push("temple_fallen_story")>><</if>>
You are in the main hall of the temple. Stone walls and pillars tower into darkness. Rows of seats face an altar at the end of the room. 
<br><br>
The usual figure wearing a white cowl is not kneeling at the altar, but rather conversing with <span class="purple">a vixen at a corner of the hall</span>.
<br><br>
You see the two of them exchanging a courteous smile before bowing to each other as their conversation ended. Poppy notices you from the corner of <<his>> eye and approaches you with a smile. "Are you here to pray?"
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<link [[Say yes|Temple Poppy Fallen Story Answer]]>><<set $poppyTempleAnswer to "yes">><</link>><br>
<<link [[Say no|Temple Poppy Fallen Story Answer]]>><<set $poppyTempleAnswer to "no">><</link>><br>
<<link [[Remain silent|Temple Poppy Fallen Story Answer]]>><<set $poppyTempleAnswer to "silent">><</link>>

:: Temple Poppy Fallen Story Answer
<<set $outside to 0>><<temple_effects>><<effects>>
<<if $poppyTempleAnswer is "yes">>
	You nod.
<<elseif $poppyTempleAnswer is "no">>
	You shake your head.
<<else>>
	You remain silent.
<</if>>
<br><br>
"You're a fallen angel, were you associated with the temple in the past?" you ask. 
<br><br>
Poppy looks a little hesitant to answer.
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<link [[Next|Temple Poppy Fallen Story Answer 2]]>><</link>>

:: Temple Poppy Fallen Story Answer 2
<<set $outside to 0>><<temple_effects>><<effects>>
"Yes. I was once very devoted to the temple, just like little Sydney over there." Poppy nudges <<his>> head in Sydney's direction. "I... went through a rebellious phase. Though, that's an understatement. I realised some terrible things about the reality I lived in and wanted to break out of it. I succeeded, but it cost me a lot."
<br><br>
<<He>> touches <<his>> blackened wing. 
<br><br>
"Do I regret it? Nope, and I never will." Poppy ends <<his>> storytelling with a grin.
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<link [[Next|Temple Poppy Fallen Story Answer 3]]>><</link>>

:: Temple Poppy Fallen Story Answer 3
<<temple_effects>><<effects>>
As quick as the grin came, it drops to a gentle smile as Poppy takes in your appearance. <<He>> pats you on the head.
<<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("fallen") gte 2)>>
	"I'm sure you've endured as much as I did. You can confide in me whenever you feel like it."
<<elseif effectiveTransformationLevel("demon") gte 2>>
	"I wish fate had been kinder to you. You've fought your way through so much, so don't give up now."
<<else>>
	"Keep up the good work, just... don't follow the path I took. It's a painful one. Unless you have a good reason to do so."
<</if>>
<br><br>
Poppy seemingly nods to <<himself>> as <<he>> moves <<his>> hand away from your head. 
<br><br>
"I think I should go. I'm not exactly... welcomed here. Not anymore. Sometimes, I think Jordan hates me because <<nnpc_he "Jordan">> can't seem to look me in the eyes anymore..." <<He>> mutters the last sentence as <<he>> walks past you.
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<link [[Next|Temple]]>><<endevent>><<set $poppyTempleAnswer to false>><</link>>

:: Street Poppy Bad Date Busy
<<effects>><<set $outside to 0>>
"Sorry, I have a lot on my plate right now," you say. As if <<he>> expected that answer from you, <<his>> smile grows colder as <<he>> releases you.
<br><br>
"That's fine, I understand." Poppy walks off.
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<endevent>><<destinationeventend>>

/* Ordinary recurring town encounters while Poppy is walking between stops. */
:: Street Poppy Passing
<<effects>><<set $outside to 1>><<npc Poppy>><<person1>><<run markPoppyInteraction()>><<set $daily.poppy.streetPassing to true>>
You spot Poppy ahead of you, walking through the crowd with a cloth bag held beneath one arm. Several spring onions stick out of the top. When someone passes close beside <<him>>, <<he>> moves the bag towards <<his>> chest so they do not knock the vegetables loose.
<br><br>
Poppy notices you through a gap in the crowd. <<He>> walks around a pair blocking the pavement, comes over to you, then starts walking beside you.
<br><br>
"There you are," <<he>> says. "I'm on my way across town. Keep me company for a little while?"
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<br><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[Walk with <<him>>|Street Poppy Passing Walk]]>><<set $phase to "walk">><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[Offer to carry the bag|Street Poppy Passing Bag]]>><<set $phase to "bag">><</link>><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Say goodbye|Street Poppy Passing Leave]]>><</link>>

:: Street Poppy Passing Walk
<<effects>><<set $outside to 1>>
You start walking beside Poppy. <<He>> walks close to you, so your sleeves brush whenever either of you moves an arm. At the first crossing, <<he>> takes hold of your wrist before stepping off the pavement. <<He>> keeps hold of you until you reach the other side, then releases your wrist.
At the next crossing, <<he>> reaches for your wrist again even though the road is empty.
<br><br>
Outside a jeweller, a couple stand beside the window and argue quietly while pointing at the rings. Poppy watches them as you pass, then leans towards your ear so the couple cannot hear <<him>>.
<br><br>
"They've been pretending to choose an engagement ring for twenty minutes," <<he>> says. "Neither wants to admit they can't afford it."
<br><br>
You continue down the street together. After a few steps, Poppy looks back at the jeweller to see whether the couple are still arguing.
<br><br>
<<link [[Ask how <<his>> day has been (0:10)|Street Poppy Passing Corner]]>><<set $phase to "day">><<pass 10>><</link>><br>
<<link [[Join in the people-watching (0:10)|Street Poppy Passing Corner]]>><<set $phase to "gossip">><<pass 10>><</link>>

:: Street Poppy Passing Bag
<<effects>><<set $outside to 1>>
You reach for the bag, but Poppy turns sideways and moves it out of your reach.
"Trying to find out what I'm making?"
<br><br>
Because the bag is heavy, it drops lower along Poppy's arm. <<He>> puts one hand beneath the bottom before it drops farther, then moves the bag back against <<his>> side. When <<he>> looks at you again, your hands are still held out, so <<he>> finally places the bag into your arms.
"Fine. But if anything breaks, I'm blaming you."
<br><br>
The bag is heavier than you expected. You lower your arms to support it, then look inside and find tins, a loaf of bread, and several packets of dried food beneath the vegetables.
<br><br>
<<link [[Ask if it is for the soup kitchen (0:10)|Street Poppy Passing Corner]]>><<set $phase to "charity">><<pass 10>><</link>><br>
<<link [[Tease <<him>> about the amount (0:10)|Street Poppy Passing Corner]]>><<set $phase to "tease">><<pass 10>><</link>>

:: Street Poppy Passing Corner
<<effects>><<set $outside to 1>><<speechresolve>>
<<if $phase is "day">>
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
		"Um... how has your day been?" you ask.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
		"How has your day been?" you ask softly.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		"Tell me how your day has been," you say.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		"How has your day been so far?" you ask.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		"So, how has your day been?" you ask.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		"All right, what have people been making you do today?" you ask.
	<<else>>
		"How has your day been?" you ask.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	"Busy," Poppy says at once. When you keep looking at <<him>>, <<he>> shifts the bag higher against <<his>> side and looks towards the shops ahead.
	"School, Bailey, the kitchen. Everyone has a little job only I can do, apparently."
	<br><br>
	<<He>> breathes out through <<his>> nose, then looks back at you. "Still, walking with you is nice."
<<elseif $phase is "gossip">>
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
		"Maybe... maybe <<hes>> hiding from an angry relative," you say, nodding towards a stern-looking shopper.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
		"What if <<hes>> hiding from an angry relative?" you ask, nodding towards a stern-looking shopper.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		"I think <<hes>> hiding from an angry relative," you say, nodding towards a stern-looking shopper.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		"I have a theory," you say, nodding towards a stern-looking shopper. "<<Hes>> hiding from an angry relative."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		"That one is definitely hiding from an angry relative," you say, nodding towards a stern-looking shopper.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		"Look at <<him>>. Definitely hiding from an angry relative," you say, nodding towards a stern-looking shopper.
	<<else>>
		You invent a dramatic history for a stern-looking shopper, claiming <<hes>> hiding from an angry relative.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	Poppy immediately shakes <<his>> head and corrects your story. <<He>> gives the stranger two secret marriages, a stolen inheritance, and a family lawyer searching the town.
	<br><br>
	You add another detail to the story, and Poppy answers with something even more ridiculous. You keep taking turns as you walk, inventing new relatives and arguments until the stranger disappears into a shop.
	When you look at Poppy, <<he>> presses <<his>> lips together and turns <<his>> face away. <<His>> shoulders move with the first laugh before <<he>> finally gives up and laughs openly.
<<elseif $phase is "charity">>
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
		"Is... is all of this for the soup kitchen?" you ask.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
		"Is this all for the soup kitchen?" you ask.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		"This is for the soup kitchen, right?" you ask.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		"Is most of this for the soup kitchen?" you ask.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		"Let me guess. Most of this is for the soup kitchen," you say.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		"Don't tell me Bailey made you haul all this around for the soup kitchen," you say.
	<<else>>
		"Is this for the soup kitchen?" you ask.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	"Most of it," Poppy says. <<He>> reaches into the bag and shifts one of the tins so the vegetables are not crushed beneath it. "People donate whatever they want to get rid of, then act surprised when we can't make dinner from six jars of mustard." <<He>> pulls out a spring onion and holds it up. "The fresh things are mine."
<<else>>
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
		"You... bought a lot," you say, adjusting the bag in your arms.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
		"This is quite a lot to carry," you say.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		"You planned for everything, didn't you?" you ask.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		"You certainly came prepared," you say, adjusting the bag in your arms.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		"You really planned ahead," you say. "This bag is packed."
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		"Bloody hell, Poppy. Were you planning to buy the whole shop?" you ask.
	<<else>>
		"You bought a lot," you say, adjusting the bag in your arms.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	"I plan ahead," Poppy says, lifting <<his>> chin. While <<he>> talks, <<he>> takes two tins from the bag in your arms and holds them beneath <<his>> own arm. With the tins removed, the bag no longer pulls your arms down as much. "Besides, I didn't know I'd have an eager little helper carrying my shopping."
<</if>>
<br><br>
At the next junction, you pass a kiosk with several pastries behind the glass. Poppy looks at the display, walks two more steps, then turns <<his>> head to look at it again. <<He>> begins walking more slowly, and you slow down beside <<him>> while <<he>> keeps looking back at the pastries.
<br><br>
<<link [[Stop for something sweet (0:10)|Street Poppy Passing Sweet]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br>
<<link [[Walk to the junction together|Street Poppy Passing Finish]]>><</link>>

:: Street Poppy Passing Sweet
<<effects>><<set $outside to 1>>
Before you can choose anything, Poppy orders one pastry and breaks it into two pieces. <<He>> looks from one half to the other, turns both pieces over, then puts the larger one into your hand.
"Don't look so pleased. That half had less sugar on it."
<br><br>
You look at both pieces and see the same amount of sugar on each one. When you look at Poppy, <<he>> lowers <<his>> eyes to <<his>> own piece, takes a bite, and gives you no answer.
<br><br>
You keep walking while you eat. When sugar sticks to your fingers, Poppy takes the bag from you so you can wipe your hands clean. After <<he>> finishes <<his>> piece, you take the bag back while <<he>> cleans <<his>> own fingers.<<llstress>><<stress -6>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Street Poppy Passing Finish]]>><</link>>

:: Street Poppy Passing Finish
<<effects>><<run poppySchedule()>><<set $outside to 1>>
Poppy stops where your routes divide and takes the bag back from you. As you lower your empty hand, <<he>> reaches out and closes <<his>> fingers around it, keeping your hand between you.
<br><br>
"That was nicer than walking alone," <<he>> says. <<He>> gently squeezes your hand without releasing it. "Find me again soon, my jewel."
<<if T.poppyLoveGainAllowed>><<npcincr Poppy love 1>><<glove>><</if>><<npcincr Poppy patience 1>><<if C.npc.Poppy.patience gte 0>><<gpatience>><<else>><<langer>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Street Poppy Passing Leave]]>><</link>>

:: Street Poppy Passing Leave
<<effects>><<set $outside to 1>>
<<if $phase is undefined>>
	"Another time, then." Poppy shifts the bag higher beneath <<his>> arm and gives you a small wave. <<He>> waits for two pedestrians to pass, then walks between them and continues down the street.
<<else>>
	Poppy waves over <<his>> shoulder and keeps walking. More people pass between you until you can no longer see <<him>>, though the spring onions remain visible above their heads for a little longer.
<</if>>
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<unset $phase>><<endevent>><<destinationeventend>>

/* Repeatable LI outings selected from Poppy's flat. */
:: Poppy Outing Choice
<<set $location to "flats">><<set $bus to "poppy_living_room">><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<speechresolve>>
<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
	"Um... would you like to go somewhere with me?" you ask.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
	"Would you like to go somewhere together?" you ask.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"I'd like to go somewhere with you, if you want to," you say.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"Would you like to go out somewhere together?" you ask.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"Come on, let's go somewhere together," you say.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"Put the book down. I'm taking you out," you say.
<<else>>
	"Let's go somewhere together," you say.
<</if>>
<br><br>
Poppy looks up from <<his>> book and keeps one finger between the pages so <<he>> does not lose <<his>> place. After hearing your question, <<he>> smiles.
"You finally asked!"
<br><br>
<<He>> closes the book, sets it aside, and gets to <<his>> feet. "Where are you taking me?"
<br><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[The park (1:00)|Poppy Outing Park]]>><<set $daily.poppy.outing to "park">><<pass 1 hour>><</link>><br>
<<foodicon "pancakes">><<link [[The Ocean Breeze café (1:00)|Poppy Outing Cafe]]>><<set $daily.poppy.outing to "cafe">><<pass 1 hour>><</link>><br>
<<refuseicon>><<link [[Reconsider|Flats Poppy Social]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>

:: Poppy Outing Park
<<set $location to "park">><<set $bus to "park">><<set $outside to 1>><<effects>><<run markPoppyInteraction()>>
You leave the flat together and walk towards the park. Poppy moves close beside you and puts <<his>> arm through yours while the pavement is clear. When several people approach from the other direction, <<he>> releases your arm so there is room for everyone to pass. Once they are behind you, <<he>> puts <<his>> arm through yours again and continues walking beside you.
<br><br>
At the park gates, Poppy stops between the path beside the river and the playground. <<He>> looks towards each one before turning to you.
<br><br>
"Your date," <<he>> says, smiling at you. "You choose."
<br><br>
<<link [[Walk beside the flowerbeds|Poppy Outing Park Walk]]>><<set $phase to "flowers">><</link>><br>
<<link [[Visit the playground|Poppy Outing Park Walk]]>><<set $phase to "playground">><</link>>

:: Poppy Outing Park Walk
<<set $location to "park">><<set $bus to "park">><<set $outside to 1>><<effects>>
<<if $phase is "flowers">>
	You follow the path beside the river, passing rows of tulips and daffodils. Poppy points to the flowers <<he>> recognises and names them as you walk. When <<he>> does not know one, <<he>> gives it a ridiculous name instead and refuses to accept your correction.
	<br><br>
	Near the end of the flowerbed, Poppy reaches towards a red poppy and touches one of the petals. When you turn towards <<him>>, <<he>> pulls <<his>> hand back.
	"I was only checking whether it was real."
	<br><br>
	One red petal comes away with <<his>> hand and rests between two of <<his>> fingers. <<He>> looks down at it, closes <<his>> hand around it, then continues walking.
<<else>>
	You lead Poppy to the playground. Before you can choose what to do, <<he>> sits on one of the swings, grips both chains, and pushes backwards with <<his>> shoes.
	"Well? Are you going to stand there pretending you're too mature?"
	<br><br>
	You sit on the swing beside <<him>> and push yourself forwards. When you swing past Poppy, <<he>> presses <<his>> shoes harder against the ground on the next pass and sends <<himself>> higher. You push harder too, and soon both of you are trying to rise above the other with every swing.
	<br><br>
	When you are nearly level with <<him>>, Poppy puts both shoes firmly on the ground. The swing slows until <<he>> can step off.
	<br><br>
	"I already won," <<he>> says, raising <<his>> chin before you can protest.
<</if>>
<br><br>
Poppy points towards a large tree beside the river and leads you across the grass. You sit down together with your backs against the trunk. Poppy shifts closer until <<his>> shoulder rests against yours.
<br><br>
<<link [[Ask what <<he>> wants from the future|Poppy Outing Park Bench]]>><<set $phase to "future">><</link>><br>
<<link [[Rest your head against <<him>>|Poppy Outing Park Bench]]>><<set $phase to "rest">><</link>><br>
<<link [[Tease <<him>> about enjoying the date|Poppy Outing Park Bench]]>><<set $phase to "tease">><</link>>

:: Poppy Outing Park Bench
<<set $location to "park">><<set $bus to "park">><<set $outside to 1>><<effects>><<speechresolve>>
<<if $phase is "future">>
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
		"Can I ask... what do you want your life to be like later?" you ask.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
		"What do you want from the future?" you ask.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		"Tell me what you want from the future," you say.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		"What would you like your future to look like?" you ask.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		"All right, your turn. What do you want from the future?" you ask.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		"So what are you actually planning for yourself, besides escaping Bailey?" you ask.
	<<else>>
		"What do you want from the future?" you ask.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	Poppy looks across the river while <<he>> thinks. "I want a home that stays mine and work I choose. My own money too, so Bailey can't summon me whenever <<he>> wants something." <<He>> turns towards you before adding, "Someone troublesome can come with it to keep things interesting."
	<br><br>
	<<He>> moves <<his>> knee sideways until it taps yours, then smiles when you turn towards <<him>>.
<<elseif $phase is "rest">>
	You rest your head on Poppy's shoulder. <<He>> stops moving when your cheek touches <<him>>. After a few seconds, <<he>> moves closer until <<his>> shoulder presses more firmly against you.
	<br><br>
	<<He>> lowers one hand to the grass beside yours and places <<his>> fingers over the back of your hand. After you leave your hand there, <<he>> moves <<his>> fingers between yours and holds your hand.
<<else>>
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
		"You look... pretty pleased with yourself," you say.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
		"You look really pleased with yourself," you say.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		"You seem pleased with yourself," you say.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		"You seem rather pleased with yourself," you say.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		"You're looking very pleased with yourself," you say.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		"You're looking smug," you say. "Enjoying yourself that much?"
	<<else>>
		"You look very pleased with yourself," you say.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	"Naturally. I have excellent company." Poppy lifts <<his>> chin. While <<he>> talks, <<his>> tail moves around your back and rests against you. "You may tell me how lucky you feel whenever you're ready."
<</if>>
<br><br>
"We should do this more often," <<he>> says. <<He>> keeps hold of your hand and looks across the park. "Somewhere ordinary, with no one demanding anything from us."
<br><br>
<<link [[Kiss <<him>>|Poppy Outing Park Finish]]>><<set $phase to "kiss">><<arousal 300>><</link>><<garousal>><<kissvirginitywarning>><br>
<<link [[Promise another date|Poppy Outing Park Finish]]>><<set $phase to "promise">><</link>><<glove>>

:: Poppy Outing Park Finish
<<set $location to "park">><<set $bus to "park">><<set $outside to 1>><<effects>>
<<if $phase is "kiss">>
	You lean towards Poppy and kiss <<him>>. <<He>> raises one hand to your cheek and kisses you back, keeping <<his>> face close to yours.
	<<takeKissVirginity "Poppy" "loveInterest">>
	<br><br>
	When you move your head back, Poppy leans forwards and kisses you again before you can move farther away. <<He>> keeps the second kiss brief, then lets you separate. Instead of moving away completely, <<he>> leans forwards until <<his>> forehead touches yours.
	"An acceptable promise."
<<else>>
	<<speechresolve>>
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
		"We could... do this again, if you want," you say.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
		"I'd like to take you out again," you say.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		"We can go out again whenever you want," you say.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		"I'd be happy to take you out again," you say.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		"We're doing this again," you say. "I'll take you out next time too."
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		"Don't get too comfortable. I'm taking you out again," you say.
	<<else>>
		You promise to take <<him>> out again.
	<</if>>
	Poppy uses one hand to brush several pieces of grass from your clothes. "Next time, I choose where we go. I expect you to be just as agreeable."
<</if>>
<<llstress>><<stress -8>><<npcincr Poppy love 2>><<gglove>><<npcincr Poppy patience 2>><<if C.npc.Poppy.patience gte 0>><<gpatience>><<else>><<langer>><</if>>
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<if isInPark("kylar")>>
	<<run statusCheck("Kylar")>>
	<<if _kylarStatus.includes("Love")>>
		Kylar watches from beneath a tree across the grass, <<nnpc_his "Kylar">> sketchbook forgotten in <<nnpc_his "Kylar">> lap.
		<<if $phase is "kiss">><<ggksuspicion>><<npcincr Kylar rage 3>><<else>><<gksuspicion>><<npcincr Kylar rage 1>><</if>>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<<unset $phase>><<link [[Stay at the park|Park]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>

:: Poppy Outing Cafe
<<set $location to "cafe">><<set $bus to "cafe">><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<run markPoppyInteraction()>>
The Ocean Breeze is busy, with people sitting at most of the tables. As you look for somewhere to sit, a couple by the window stand up and begin putting on their coats.
<br><br>
Poppy notices at the same time. <<He>> takes your hand and leads you across the café before anyone else reaches the empty table.
"Perfect!"
<br><br>
<<He>> takes the chair facing the window and opens the menu. <<He>> reads through the list of main meals, but keeps looking away from the menu towards the desserts beside the counter.
<br><br>
<<foodicon "pancakes">><<link [[Order pancakes to share|Poppy Outing Cafe Meal]]>><<set $phase to "pancakes">><</link>><br>
<<foodicon "crepes">><<link [[Order cake first|Poppy Outing Cafe Meal]]>><<set $phase to "cake">><</link>><br>
<<foodicon "coffee">><<link [[Let Poppy order for both of you|Poppy Outing Cafe Meal]]>><<set $phase to "poppy">><</link>>

:: Poppy Outing Cafe Meal
<<set $location to "cafe">><<set $bus to "cafe">><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>>
<<if $phase is "pancakes">>
	You order pancakes to share. When they arrive, Poppy uses the knife to divide the stack into two halves and moves one half onto each plate.
	<br><br>
	<<He>> looks at the food on your plate, reaches across, and takes one piece of fruit. Before you can complain, <<he>> picks up the largest piece from <<his>> own plate and places it on yours in exchange.
	<br><br>
	"Fair trade," <<he>> says, already eating the fruit <<he>> took from you.
<<elseif $phase is "cake">>
	You order two slices of cake before either of you chooses a proper meal. When the plates arrive, Poppy raises <<his>> fork towards you. You touch your fork against <<his>>, then both start eating.
	"I knew there was a reason I liked you."
	<br><br>
	You keep talking between bites and finish the cake slowly. By the time both plates are empty, neither of you wants to order a larger meal.
<<else>>
	Poppy orders tea, pancakes, and fruit for both of you without asking what you want. When the food arrives, you realise <<he>> chose exactly what you would have ordered yourself. You look at <<him>>. "What? I pay attention," <<he>> says, then looks down at the table and starts straightening the cutlery beside <<his>> plate.
<</if>>
<br><br>
As you finish the last of the food, both of you spend more time eating than talking. Poppy moves one foot beneath the table until the side of <<his>> shoe touches yours. <<He>> leaves it against your shoe while <<he>> takes another drink of tea.
<br><br>
<<link [[Ask about Poppy's week|Poppy Outing Cafe Talk]]>><<set $phase to "poppy">><</link>><br>
<<link [[Tell <<him>> about your week|Poppy Outing Cafe Talk]]>><<set $phase to "player">><</link>><br>
<<link [[Flirt with <<him>>|Poppy Outing Cafe Talk]]>><<set $phase to "flirt">><</link>><<promiscuous1>>

:: Poppy Outing Cafe Talk
<<set $location to "cafe">><<set $bus to "cafe">><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<speechresolve>>
<<if $phase is "poppy">>
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
		"Um... how has your week been?" you ask.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
		"How has your week been?" you ask.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		"Tell me about your week," you say.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		"How has your week been going?" you ask.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		"All right, tell me about your week," you say.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		"Come on, tell me what kind of mess Bailey gave you this week," you say.
	<<else>>
		"How has your week been?" you ask.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	Poppy tells you about school first, then lists several jobs Bailey gave <<him>> during the week. When <<he>> reaches the soup kitchen, <<he>> leans forwards and explains that someone poured chilli powder from an unlabelled jar into a large pot of food.
	<br><br>
	<<He>> shows you the face Bailey made after the first taste, then repeats Bailey's complaint. Poppy adds more details each time <<he>> tells it, until <<he>> starts laughing at <<his>> own version of the story.
	<br><br>
	When <<he>> finishes, <<he>> leans back in the chair and holds the teacup between both hands. "It has been tiring," <<he>> admits. "I'm glad you asked me out."
<<elseif $phase is "player">>
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
		"My week was... a bit much," you say before telling Poppy what happened.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
		"My week has been difficult," you say before telling Poppy what happened.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		"I'll tell you about mine," you say, then explain how your week went.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		"If you don't mind listening, my week has been rather busy too," you say before telling <<him>> what happened.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		"All right, my turn," you say before telling Poppy about your week.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		"Since you asked, you get the whole mess," you say before telling Poppy about your week.
	<<else>>
		You tell Poppy about your week.
	<</if>>
	At first <<he>> interrupts whenever <<he>> thinks <<he>> knows how to solve one of your problems. After doing it twice, <<he>> starts to interrupt again, stops after the first word, then waits for you to finish. When you reach the end, <<he>> places <<his>> hand over yours on the table. "You should have told me sooner. You don't have to deal with all of that by yourself."
<<else>>
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
		"The view over here is... better than the one outside," you say, looking at Poppy.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
		"I think the view across the table is nicer than the one outside," you say.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		"I like looking at you more than the view outside," you say.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		"I have to admit, the view across the table is much better," you say.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		"You're much nicer to look at than anything outside," you say.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		"Why would I look outside when I've got you sitting there?" you ask.
	<<else>>
		You tell Poppy that the view across the table is better than the one through the window.
	<</if>>
	<<His>> cheeks turn red. <<He>> raises <<his>> teacup until it covers part of <<his>> face, but you can still see <<him>> smiling behind it.
	"Careful, my jewel. If you keep talking like that, everyone will know this is a date."
	<br><br>
	Beneath the table, <<he>> slides the side of <<his>> shoe along your ankle, then pulls <<his>> foot back.<<arousal 400>><<garousal>><<npcincr Poppy lust 1>><<glust>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
A waiter comes over to collect the empty plates and asks whether you are celebrating anything. Poppy raises <<his>> teacup, but pauses before drinking and looks at you to see what you will say.
<br><br>
<<link [["Just having a date"|Poppy Outing Cafe Finish]]>><<set $phase to "date">><</link>><br>
<<link [["Celebrating Poppy"|Poppy Outing Cafe Finish]]>><<set $phase to "poppy">><</link>><br>
<<link [[Let Poppy answer|Poppy Outing Cafe Finish]]>><<set $phase to "answer">><</link>>

:: Poppy Outing Cafe Finish
<<set $location to "cafe">><<set $bus to "cafe">><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<speechresolve>>
<<if $phase is "date">>
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
		"We're... just having a date," you say.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
		"We're just having a date," you say.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		"It's a date," you say.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		"We're enjoying a date together," you say.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		"We're on a date," you say.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		"Obviously, we're on a date," you say.
	<<else>>
		"Just a date," you say.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	Poppy lowers <<his>> eyes to the teacup while the waiter finishes clearing the table. Once the waiter leaves, <<he>> looks back at you and repeats, "A date," with a wider smile.
<<elseif $phase is "poppy">>
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
		"We're... celebrating Poppy," you say.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
		"We're celebrating Poppy," you say.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		"I wanted to celebrate Poppy today," you say.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		"We're celebrating Poppy today," you say.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		"Poppy. That's what we're celebrating," you say.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		"<<nnpc_Him 'Poppy'>>, obviously," you say, pointing at Poppy. "We're celebrating Poppy."
	<<else>>
		"We're celebrating Poppy," you say.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	Poppy has the cup at <<his>> mouth when you answer. <<He>> suddenly coughs and lowers the cup before any tea spills. Keeping one hand over <<his>> mouth, <<he>> coughs twice more and takes a slow breath.
	<br><br>
	When <<he>> can speak normally again, <<he>> raises the cup near <<his>> face and looks at you. "As you should," <<he>> says, then taps your ankle with the side of <<his>> shoe beneath the table.
<<else>>
	Poppy takes your hand before answering. "We're celebrating finding time for each other," <<he>> says. When the waiter leaves, <<he>> looks down at your hands, which are still holding each other, and clears <<his>> throat. "And the cake," <<he>> adds quickly.
<</if>>
<br><br>
After the bill is settled, Poppy remains at the table while the waiter takes away the last cup. <<He>> keeps your hand in <<his>>, rubbing <<his>> thumb slowly across the back of it.
"You chose well, my jewel," <<he>> says. "Next time, I'm paying."
<<llstress>><<stress -6>><<npcincr Poppy love 2>><<gglove>><<npcincr Poppy patience 2>><<if C.npc.Poppy.patience gte 0>><<gpatience>><<else>><<langer>><</if>>
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<unset $phase>><<link [[Stay at the café|Ocean Breeze]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Park Poppy
<<endevent>>
<<set $location to "park">><<set $bus to "park">><<set $outside to 1>><<effects>><<run poppySchedule()>><<npc Poppy>><<person1>><<run markPoppyInteraction()>><<set $daily.poppy.parkVisit to true>>
You find Poppy by the riverside railing, tearing pieces from a loaf and dropping them onto the path.
<br><br>
Several pigeons gather directly around <<his>> shoes to reach the bread first, while a duck waits farther away on the riverbank. When Poppy notices you, <<he>> stops tearing the piece in <<his>> hand and holds it out to you with a grin.
"Don't worry. I saved some for my favourite visitor."
<br><br>
<<link [[Share it with the birds|Park Poppy Birds]]>><<set $phase to "share">><</link>><br>
<<link [[Eat it yourself|Park Poppy Birds]]>><<set $phase to "eat">><</link>><br>
<<link [[Ask what <<hes>> doing here|Park Poppy Birds]]>><<set $phase to "ask">><</link>>

:: Park Poppy Birds
<<set $location to "park">><<set $bus to "park">><<set $outside to 1>><<effects>>
<<if $phase is "share">>
	You break the bread into smaller pieces and scatter them across the path. The pigeons hurry towards the nearest pieces, pushing past one another until several of them are standing directly around your shoes.
	<br><br>
	Poppy shakes <<his>> head at them. <<He>> takes one piece of bread from your hand and throws it farther away, towards the duck waiting by the riverbank.
	"You have to watch the greedy ones. They'll take everything if you let them."
<<elseif $phase is "eat">>
	You put the bread into your mouth instead.
	<br><br>
	Poppy stops with the loaf halfway behind <<his>> back. <<He>> looks at you, then at the pigeons waiting around your shoes, before looking back at you again.
	"Cruel..." <<he>> says. "I offer you a position of great responsibility and you abuse it immediately."
	<br><br>
	<<He>> brings the loaf forwards again, breaks off another piece, and places it in your hand.
<<else>>
	<<speechresolve>>
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
		"Um... what brought you out here?" you ask.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
		"What are you doing out here today?" you ask.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		"Tell me why you came here," you say.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		"What brought you to the park today?" you ask.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		"So, why are you hiding out here with the birds?" you ask.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		"What are you doing out here bribing birds with bread?" you ask.
	<<else>>
		"What are you doing out here?" you ask.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	"I come here when going all the way to the lake would take too long and I don't want to stay inside my flat," Poppy says. <<He>> throws another piece of bread towards the riverbank, and the duck hurries after it. "The birds don't ask questions, unless you count that duck. It judges everything I do."
<</if>>
<br><br>
Farther along the path, a gust of wind blows a paper windmill out of a child's hand and sends it across the path towards the riverbank. The child runs after it, but another gust moves it farther away before <<he>> can reach it.
<br><br>
Poppy leaves the railing and runs after the windmill. Before it reaches the river, <<he>> puts one shoe down on the wooden stick and holds it against the ground.
<br><br>
<<link [[Praise <<him>>|Park Poppy Windmill]]>><<set $phase to "praise">><</link>><br>
<<link [[Tease <<him>> for showing off|Park Poppy Windmill]]>><<set $phase to "tease">><</link>><br>
<<link [[Help return it|Park Poppy Windmill]]>><<set $phase to "help">><</link>>

:: Park Poppy Windmill
<<set $location to "park">><<set $bus to "park">><<set $outside to 1>><<effects>><<speechresolve>>
<<if $phase is "praise">>
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
		"That was... really impressive," you say.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
		"That was really impressive," you say.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		"You did that well," you say.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		"That was very impressive," you say.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		"You stopped it before it reached the river. That was really impressive," you say.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		"All right, show-off. That was impressive," you say.
	<<else>>
		"That was impressive," you say.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	Poppy lifts <<his>> shoe and checks the paper for damage before picking the windmill up by its wooden stick. <<He>> smiles at you and raises <<his>> chin. "I know. You may praise me again after I return it."
<<elseif $phase is "tease">>
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
		"Were you... showing off for me?" you ask.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
		"Were you showing off for me?" you ask.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		"You were showing off for me, weren't you?" you ask.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		"Did you do that because I was watching?" you ask.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		"You were showing off for me," you say.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		"You smug little show-off. That was for me, wasn't it?" you ask.
	<<else>>
		"Showing off for me?" you ask.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	Poppy runs one hand over <<his>> hair, carefully pushing it back into place, then looks at you. "Of course not. I would have done exactly the same if you weren't here. Perhaps with less style."
<<else>>
	You walk back with Poppy and return the windmill to the child. The child grabs it with both hands and runs back towards the adult waiting farther along the path without saying anything. Poppy watches <<him>> go. "Apparently even a thank-you was too much effort. I accept that we are heroes anyway."
<</if>>
<br><br>
You continue around the park together, following the path back towards the gate. Whenever Poppy sees a flower <<he>> likes, <<he>> points it out and talks about where <<he>> could put a pot for it inside <<his>> flat.
<br><br>
When you pass the first statue, <<he>> stops talking about flowers and looks up at its bare head.
"That needs a hat."
<br><br>
At the next statue, <<he>> chooses a different kind of hat. By the time you reach the last path, Poppy has decided which stolen hat would look best on nearly every statue in the park.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Park Poppy Finish]]>><</link>>

:: Park Poppy Finish
<<set $location to "park">><<set $bus to "park">><<set $outside to 1>><<effects>><<run poppySchedule()>>
Poppy stops at the gate and reaches up to your collar. <<He>> folds one side back into place, then smooths the fabric down with <<his>> fingers.
<br><br>
"I should keep moving," <<he>> says. "Unlike certain people, I do have a schedule."
<<He>> starts towards town. After two steps, <<he>> stops and turns back to you.
<br><br>
Before you can ask why, Poppy steps back towards you and kisses your cheek. <<He>> moves away with a smile, turns towards town, and continues walking while you are still deciding what to say.<<if T.poppyLoveGainAllowed>><<npcincr Poppy love 1>><<glove>><</if>><<npcincr Poppy patience 1>><<if C.npc.Poppy.patience gte 0>><<gpatience>><<else>><<langer>><</if>>
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<if isInPark("kylar")>>
	<<run statusCheck("Kylar")>>
	<<if _kylarStatus.includes("Love")>>
		Kylar watches from beneath a tree across the grass, <<nnpc_his "Kylar">> sketchbook forgotten in <<nnpc_his "Kylar">> lap.
		<<gksuspicion>><<npcincr Kylar rage 1>>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<<unset $phase>><<link [[Next|Park]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>

:: Street Poppy Bad Date Accept
<<effects>><<set $outside to 0>><<run poppySchedule()>>
"All right. Let's go on a date." You smile back. 
<br><br>
Poppy's eyes light up at your answer. A genuine smile forms on <<his>> lips as <<he>> intertwines <<his>> fingers with yours. "Okay! I've already planned out what we should do." 
<br><br>
Poppy leads you to the forest, <<his>> excitement evident in <<his>> steps.
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<link [[Next|Street Poppy Bad Date Picnic]]>><<pass 20>><</link>>

:: Street Poppy Bad Date Picnic
<<set $bus to "lakewaterfall">><<effects>><<lakeeffects>><<set $location to "lake">><<set $outside to 0>>
Poppy stops as the two of you arrive at the lake. You can see that a simple picnic was prepared beside the lakeshore. Poppy leads you over and sits across from you on the red and white checkered picnic blanket.
<br><br>
"Sorry, I was in a rush while preparing this." Poppy gives you an apologetic smile. <<He>> pulls out a pan of quiche, cuts out a slice and hands it to you. "I made it myself, I hope you'll like it."
<br><br>
You take a bite out of the slice of quiche. It's savoury and full of filling.
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<link [[Say that it tastes delicious|Street Poppy Bad Date Praise]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Say that you hate it|Street Poppy Bad Date Insult]]>><</link>>

:: Street Poppy Bad Date Praise
<<effects>><<lakeeffects>><<set $outside to 0>>
"It's delicious, I can't believe you made something like this. No one could make it as good as you." You praise. Poppy smiles bashfully.
<br><br>
"I-I'm glad you like it... if you like it that much, I can make it for you more often." Poppy stammers.<<npcincr Poppy love 1>><<glove>>
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<link [[Next|Street Poppy Bad Date Return]]>><<pass 40>><</link>>

:: Street Poppy Bad Date Insult
<<effects>><<lakeeffects>>
"It tastes horrible," you say. "The orphanage makes better food than this."
<br><br>
<<if $awarelevel gte 5>>
	Poppy's fox ears droop as <<he>> lowers <<his>> gaze.
<<else>>
	Poppy lowers <<his>> gaze.
<</if>>
"I'm sorry, I'll do better next time..."<<npcincr Poppy love -2>><<llove>>
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<link [[Next|Street Poppy Bad Date Return]]>><<pass 40>><</link>>

:: Street Poppy Bad Date Return
<<set $bus to "domus">><<effects>><<set $location to "town">><<set $outside to 0>>
The picnic goes by uneventfully with some small talk. Poppy walks you back into town. "I had a lot of fun. I hope we can do this more often."
<br><br>
Poppy glances at the orphanage over your shoulder. "Since we're at your place, do you want to..." <<He>> leaves the implication hanging in the air as <<he>> takes a step closer and places a hand on your chest.
<<arousal 200>><<garousal>><<npcincr Poppy lust 1>><<glust>>
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<if $promiscuity gte 1>>
	<<link [[Allow it|Poppy Take Further Return Home]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<span class="black">Allow it</span> | <span class="purple">Requires Promiscuity 1.</span>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<link [[Reject the advance|Street Poppy Bad Date Reject]]>><</link>>

:: Street Poppy Bad Date Reject
<<effects>><<set $outside to 0>>
You take a step back from <<him>>. Poppy takes the hint and doesn't press further.
<br><br>
With a smile and a wave, <<he>> walks off.
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<link [[Next|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Pregnancy Birth Hospital Poppy
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "hospital">><<effects>>
<<endevent>><<npc "Poppy">><<person1>>
<<run poppySchedule()>><<run markPoppyInteraction()>>
<<run delete $poppy_pregnancy>>
<<getChildrenIds>><<childSelect _childrenIds.last()>>
Poppy is on <<his>> feet the moment <<he>> sees you, crossing the ward before the midwife can get a word out.
<br><br>
"My jewel," <<he>> breathes, taking your hands in <<his>>. "You did it. You actually did it."
<<if $litter_size gte 2>>
	<<He>> glances to where <<childrenNames $bornChildrenIds>> lie swaddled in their cradles, and <<his>> breath catches. "Look at them. Look at what we made."
<<else>>
	<<He>> glances to where <<childname>> lies swaddled in the cradle, and <<his>> breath catches. "Look at <<childhim>>. Look at what we made."
<</if>>
<br><br>
Poppy leans down and brushes the backs of <<his>> fingers over <<if $litter_size gte 2>>the nearest tiny cheek<<else>><<childname>>'s cheek<</if>>, careful as though afraid of leaving a mark.
A faint powdery scent follows <<him>>, and for once you're too worn out to mind it.
<br><br>
"I'm so proud of you." <<He>> presses a lingering kiss to your damp forehead. "Rest now. I'll take care of everything else. That's a promise."<<lllstress>><<stress -20>><<glove>><<npcincr Poppy love 2>>
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<link [[Next|Pregnancy Birth Hospital 6]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

/*
	Entry point reached from :: Flats Knock when
	  - Mod LI Poppy is selected
	  - Poppy is introduced / initialised
	  - player is not yet Poppy's LI
	  - player has not yet unlocked Poppy's flat
	  - it is not blood moon
	  - Poppy is home
	  - Poppy love is Mid or higher
	  - Poppy patience is Mid or higher

	This is a one-time RNG knock event, not a repeatable social loop.
	Successful completion of the associated work event unlocks Poppy's flat.
*/
:: Flats Poppy Knock Ask
<<effects>><<set $outside to 0>><<run poppySchedule()>>
"I need someone to tend to the flowers around my place. I'm a very busy <<if C.npc.Poppy.pronoun is "m">>man<<else>>woman<</if>> and always forget to take care of them. I'll pay you £50."
<<poppyOpiumPulse>><<run markPoppyInteraction()>>
<<getinicon>><<link [[Accept (1:00)|Flats Poppy Knock Work]]>><<pass 60>><</link>><br>
<<refuseicon>><<link [[Refuse|Flats]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Flats Poppy Knock Work
<<effects>><<set $outside to 0>>
"Wonderful," Poppy smiles at you. "Come in!" <<He>> leads you into the living room.
<br><br>
"There's a pot of poppies in every room. Except for the bathroom. I'm counting on you to take care of them." <<He>> flashes you a gentle smile.
<br><br>
You move around the flat, tending each pot of poppies with care. You carefully pull out the weeds growing around the flowers, water the soil, and sprinkle a little fertiliser around them.
<br><br>
As you're tending the last pot, Poppy approaches to inspect your work.<<gtending>><<tending 5>>
<<poppyOpiumPulse false true>>
<<link [[Next|Flats Poppy Knock Work 2]]>><</link>>

:: Flats Poppy Knock Work 2
<<effects>><<set $outside to 0>>
<<if currentSkillValue('tending') gte 1000>>
	"You have a way with plants, don't you? I'm impressed. Thank you for your help."
	<br><br>
	You make <<income 20000 "flatsCleaning">>.
<<elseif currentSkillValue('tending') gte 500>>
	"Not bad, thank you for your help."
	<br><br>
	You make <<income 10000 "flatsCleaning">>.
<<else>>
	"Hm... it could have been better, but still, thank you."
	<br><br>
	You make <<income 5000 "flatsCleaning">>.
<</if>>
<br><br>
"If you have time, could you swing by and help with the poppies again?" Poppy asks. "In return, I'll let you hang around my flat. The bedroom is off limits though."
<br><br>
You nod, and leave the flat.
<<poppyOpiumPulse>><<set $poppySafeHouse to 1>>
<span class="gold"><i>You now have access to Poppy's flat! Except for the bedroom.</i></span><br>
<<link [[Next|Flats]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

/* Math study */
:: Maths Project Stim Poppy
<<effects>><<endevent>>
<<npc Poppy>><<person1>>
Just as you are about to pop a stimulant into your mouth, you hear the bedroom door open. Poppy enters the room and notices you. 
"Ah, you're studying. I hope I didn't disturb you." <<He>> notices the stimulant in your hand, <<his>> expression turns into a look of suspicion. "What's that in your hand?" 
<br><br>
Before you can respond, Poppy has taken the stimulant from your hand and is inspecting it. 
"You're using drugs to study, hm? That's bad for your health, and a proper student does not need drugs to help them perform better. Do refrain from using any drugs in my home. I will not warn you twice."
<<npcincr Poppy love -2>><<llove>><<npcincr Poppy patience -2>><<if C.npc.Poppy.patience gte 0>><<llpatience>><<else>><<gganger>><</if>>
<br><br>
Poppy tosses the stimulant into the trash and leaves the room.
<br><br>
<<set $poppySeen.push("stimulant_use")>>
<<link [[Next|Flats Poppy Bedroom]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Street Poppy Valentines Accept
<<set $valentines_poppy_flat_accept to 1>><<unset $valentines_poppy_flat_decline>><<unset $valentines_poppy_flat_missed>><<unset $valentines_poppy_flat_done>>
"Of course, I'd be happy to spend Valentines with you." You say. The moment you agree, Poppy's eyes alight with excitement. "Great! Be there at 8pm alright? Don't be late now!"
<br><br>
Poppy blows a kiss to you with a wink before leaving. It seems you've got plans for Valentine's Day now.
<br><br>
<span class ="gold">Valentine's date with Poppy has been added to your journal.</span>
<br><br>
<<endevent>>
<<destinationeventend>>

:: Street Poppy Valentines Decline
<<set $valentines_poppy_flat_decline to 1>><<unset $valentines_poppy_flat_accept>><<unset $valentines_poppy_flat_missed>><<unset $valentines_poppy_flat_done>>
"Sorry, I have other plans for Valentines." You say. You swear you see the slightest twitch at the corner of <<his>> lips, though the smile never leaves <<his>> face. You feel a sudden heaviness in the air. <<npcincr Poppy patience -1>><<lpatience>>
<br><br>
"Oh… is that so? Well, I suppose it can't be helped then. I guess I'll be spending Valentine's Day by myself." Poppy said as <<he>> turns away and walks off stiffly.
<<if $awarelevel gte 5>>
	You can see Poppy's tail swishing angrily back and forth. <<Hes>> probably not going to forget this for awhile.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<endevent>>
<<destinationeventend>>

/* While Poppy is under a body-changing X-Change pill: Poppy drops by Bailey's office. Fired from homeevent at most once a day. */
:: Poppy Pilled Orphanage
<<endevent>><<npc "Poppy">><<person1>>
<<switch random(1, 2)>>
	<<case 1>>
		Laughter carries from Bailey's office. The door is open, and Poppy is perched on the edge of the desk in <<his>> new body, swinging <<his>> legs while Bailey tries to work around <<him>>.
		<br><br>
		"Admit it, it suits me," Poppy says.
		<br><br>
		"It doesn't matter what it suits," Bailey says without looking up. "You're late for the soup kitchen either way."
		<br><br>
		Poppy spots you in the doorway and waves. "My jewel! Bailey was just asking who did this to me." <<His>> eyes glint. "I told <<nnpc_him "Bailey">> it was none of <<nnpc_his "Bailey">> business."
		<br><br>
		Bailey's gaze shifts to you and stays there a moment too long. <span class="red">You get the feeling <<nnpc_he "Bailey">> already knows.</span>
	<<case 2>>
		You pass Poppy in the main hall, carrying a crate of donated tins towards the kitchen. A few of the younger orphans trail after <<him>>, whispering, unsure whether this is the same Poppy.
		<br><br>
		<<He>> sets the crate down and crouches to their height. "Yes, it's still me. No, I'm not telling you how. Go and wash your hands."
		<br><br>
		They scatter. Poppy straightens up, catches your eye, and leans in close as <<he>> passes. "Bailey hasn't said a word about it. That's how I know <<nnpc_hes "Bailey">> bothered." <<He>> winks. "Behave yourself, or I'll tell <<nnpc_him "Bailey">> whose pill it was."
<</switch>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
